@startuml
title Himeros — System Context / Target Logical Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12

actor "Member" as user
rectangle "Angular 22 Web" as web
rectangle "Future Flutter App" as mobile
rectangle "Edge / WAF / TLS" as edge
rectangle "Himeros Backend\nModular Monolith" as core
database "PostgreSQL" as pg
rectangle "Redis" as redis
queue "Kafka" as kafka
cloud "Object Storage + CDN\n(production adapter)" as storage
cloud "Email / Push / PSP\n(production adapters)" as providers

user --> web
user --> mobile
web --> edge : HTTPS / WSS
mobile --> edge : HTTPS / WSS
edge --> core : REST / STOMP
core --> pg : transactional state
core --> redis : rate limit / ephemeral
core --> kafka : Outbox relay
core --> storage : media port
core --> providers : integration ports

note bottom of core
Logical boundaries are designed for extraction.
Initial deployment stays intentionally consolidated
until workload/ownership justify distribution.
end note
@enduml
